  "description": "LUYGAO crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C165 H199 Gd4 N1 O23 S16,3.41(C1 H2 Cl2). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.555-4.706 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 91.25-160.92°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C165H199Gd4NO23S16·3.41(CH2Cl2).",
